#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""LGBM Transition Model for Colombia Dataset (5-Year Lookahead Prediction)
Train LightGBM on pre-split parquet files: train_colombia_win5 (2000-2014), 
val_colombia_win5 (2015-2017), test_colombia_win5 (2018-2019). Final model trained on 2000-2014,
with early stopping on 2015-2017, evaluated on 2018-2019.
Target: transition_01_win5 (1 if transition occurs within next 5 years, else 0)

Features:
- Temporal Cross-Validation: 3 folds with different train/val year splits
- Time-based Sample Weighting: Later training years get higher weights
  (Year 2000: weight 0.5, Year 2014: weight 1.0, linear interpolation in between)
- Right-Censoring Protection: Validation and test data filtered to LAST_LABEL_YEAR
  (LAST_LABEL_YEAR = WDPA_LAST_YEAR - LOOKAHEAD_YEARS) to avoid evaluating on
  labels that don't have complete 5-year lookahead information
"""

